    0.000762,                 !- Cooling Minimum Air Flow per Zone Floor Area
    0,                        !- Cooling Minimum Air Flow
    0.2,                      !- Cooling Minimum Air Flow Fraction
    DesignDay,                !- Heating Design Air Flow Method
